note 03_input_calculator.vss — Interactive Calculator
make num1 becomes 10
make num2 becomes 5

ask "Enter first number: " into num1
ask "Enter second number: " into num2

make sum becomes num1 + num2
make diff becomes num1 - num2
make prod becomes num1 * num2

say "Sum: " + sum
say "Difference: " + diff
say "Product: " + prod
